    "project_purpose": "Azuro is infrastructure for on-chain betting and prediction markets, providing liquidity, market, oracle/resolution, and payout tooling for applications built on the protocol. It should not be characterized primarily as project-owned cross-chain asset movement infrastructure unless supported by Azuro-specific documentation or audited code.",
